Title: Midnight Dispatch
Credit: Written by
Author: DocIntel Demo
Draft date: 2026-08-25

INT. NEON COFFEE SHOP - NIGHT

Rain lashes against the fogged-up glass windows. The streetlights outside bleed pink and blue into the dim room.

A weary programmer sits huddled over a glowing laptop, surrounded by empty espresso cups.

MAYA
(whispering to herself)
Just one more integration test and we are golden.

The door chimes open with a sharp rattle. A courier in a soaked raincoat steps inside.

COURIER
Delivery for Maya Vance. Priority dispatch.

Maya looks up, eyes wide with anticipation.

MAYA
(breathless)
Did the hardware specs arrive?

COURIER
Right here. Sign on the terminal.

CUT TO:

EXT. METROPOLIS ALLEY - CONTINUOUS

The courier vanishes into the downpour.
